  "goodToKnow": "Offenbaren means to reveal or disclose: ein Geheimnis offenbaren, seine Gefühle offenbaren. It's slightly formal and dramatic. Sich offenbaren means to reveal oneself or open up to someone. Die Offenbarung is revelation, both religious (die Offenbarung des Johannes, the Book of Revelation) and casual: Das Essen war eine Offenbarung! The adverb offenbar means apparently: Er hat es offenbar vergessen."
